# lint: loaded-by ui.eigs -- fragment of the ui toolkit: the composer binds the shared state (_theme, _ui, the widget registry) and every sibling fragment. Declared as a fragment rather than silencing E003 wholesale (#874) — that keeps undefined-name protection, and the UI subtree is where cold branches are densest.
